      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-web-search-brave\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/dsh-web-search-brave\" alt=\"npm version\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-web-search-brave\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/dsh-web-search-brave\" alt=\"npm downloads\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-brave\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-brave\" alt=\"GitHub stars\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-brave/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-brave\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-web-search-brave",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nA [Brave Search](https://api.search.brave.com)-backed search provider for the [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) web capability seam (`ctx.web`): it makes the built-in `web_search` tool run on Brave's Search Web API instead of the shipped DeepSeek route.\n\n**DSH compatibility:** validated with `0.2.0-rc.2`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Clean snippets** - `text_decorations` defaults to false so snippets stay free of `<b>` highlight markers.\n- **Dates** - `page_age` (ISO 8601) maps to the seam's `publishedAt`; human-readable `age` is ignored.\n- **Keyed only** - Brave has no keyless mode; free tier: 2,000 queries/month at [api.search.brave.com](https://api.search.brave.com)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-web-search-brave\n```\n\nSet your API key in DSH's credential store (recommended) or export it in the environment that starts `dsh web`:\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml",
      "text": "BRAVE_API_KEY: BSA...\n```\n\nSelect the provider (the bundle patch does this automatically; to switch manually):\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "your profile's cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "- id: web\n  name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-web'\n  config:\n    searchProvider: brave\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
